[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":273},"routes/guides.$slug",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8},"guide",{"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":30},"title","Christmas Gifts for Boyfriend: 25 Ideas He Will Actually Use","slug","christmas-gifts-for-boyfriend","category","gifts-for-him","seoTitle","Christmas Gifts for Boyfriend: 25 Ideas He Will Actually Use (2026)","metaDescription","Stuck on what to get your boyfriend for Christmas? 25 gifts he will actually use, from sentimental keepsakes to cozy upgrades, each loved by thousands of buyers.","image","/images/eb2dd3d3-a6b8-4711-ab59-7ff2b6995f85.webp","imageAlt","Flat lay of a leather wallet, wristwatch and folded shirt as gifts for him","intro","Let us guess: you asked him what he wants for Christmas and he said \"nothing, I'm good.\" Classic. Do not worry, we did the hard part. Every gift on this list has thousands of happy buyers, and every one is something he will use long after December 25. Short on time? Our top pick is the engraved wallet card: it costs little, he carries it every day, and it says exactly what you want it to say. Order by mid-December so it arrives in time.","sections",[96,97,98,99,100],"comparison",{"_48":49,"_50":51},"faq",[31,32,33,34,35],{"_36":46,"_38":47},{"_36":44,"_38":45},{"_36":42,"_38":43},{"_36":40,"_38":41},{"_36":37,"_38":39},"question","When should I order Christmas gifts on Amazon?","answer","By mid-December for most items. Engraved and personalized gifts take longer, so order those first.","What are good stocking stuffers for a boyfriend?","Small things he will use every day: an engraved wallet card, an AirTag for his keys, or a What I Love About You book you fill in yourself.","What is a good Christmas gift for a new boyfriend?","Keep it thoughtful but not too intense: a cozy hoodie, a card game you can play together, or a fun gift for his hobby.","What is a good sentimental Christmas gift for a boyfriend?","An engraved wallet card with your own message. It is small, he carries it every day, and it says exactly what you want it to say.","What should I get my boyfriend for Christmas if he says he wants nothing?","Get something he uses every day but would never buy himself: a new wallet, a good hoodie or a better cologne. Add a personal touch like an engraved wallet card and it becomes unforgettable.","columns",[93,94,95],"rows",[52,53,54,55,56,57,58,59],{"_60":89,"_62":90},{"_60":86,"_62":87},{"_60":82,"_62":83},{"_60":78,"_62":79},{"_60":74,"_62":75},{"_60":70,"_62":71},{"_60":66,"_62":67},{"_60":61,"_62":63},"label","Meat thermometer","values",[64,65],"Grill lovers","Every cookout","Cologne",[68,69],"Style upgrade","Every morning","Neck massager",[72,73],"Stressed or sore","Every evening","Wearable blanket",[76,77],"Couch lovers","Every night in","YETI tumbler",[80,81],"Busy mornings","Every day","Carhartt hoodie",[84,85],"Cozy winter","Every week","Leather wallet",[88,81],"Practical guys","Engraved wallet card",[91,92],"Sentimental guys","Every day, forever","Gift","Best for","He will use it",{"_101":252,"_103":253,"_105":254},{"_101":207,"_103":208,"_105":209},{"_101":180,"_103":181,"_105":182},{"_101":153,"_103":154,"_105":155},{"_101":102,"_103":104,"_105":106},"heading","Gifts for his hobbies","text","Show him you pay attention to what he loves. These are fun, a little playful, and perfect for the guy who has a hobby he will not stop talking about.","products",[107,108,109,110,111,112,113],{"_114":148,"_19":149,"_117":150,"_119":151,"_121":152},{"_114":143,"_19":144,"_117":145,"_119":146,"_121":147},{"_114":138,"_19":139,"_117":140,"_119":141,"_121":142},{"_114":133,"_19":134,"_117":135,"_119":136,"_121":137},{"_114":128,"_19":129,"_117":130,"_119":131,"_121":132},{"_114":123,"_19":124,"_117":125,"_119":126,"_121":127},{"_114":115,"_19":116,"_117":118,"_119":120,"_121":122},"name","For the guy who cooks: Lodge 12-inch cast iron skillet","https://images.pexels.com/photos/33429151/pexels-photo-33429151.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","alt","Meal cooking in a cast iron skillet","description","Perfect steaks, crispy potatoes, campfire breakfasts. A kitchen classic made in the USA that lasts a lifetime (people really pass these down). It comes pre-seasoned and ready to cook.","amazonUrl","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006JSUB?tag=relations0237-20","For the reader: Kindle Paperwhite","https://images.pexels.com/photos/31145650/pexels-photo-31145650.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Person reading on an e-reader at home","Thousands of books in his pocket, a glare-free screen for reading in the sun, and a battery that lasts for weeks. Over 23,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DDZJS3SB?tag=relations0237-20","For the gym guy: TOLOCO massage gun","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6389069/pexels-photo-6389069.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Fit man using a massage gun after a workout","Sore legs after leg day? This handheld massager works out the knots in minutes. It comes with 10 heads and has over 62,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083L8RNJR?tag=relations0237-20","For the coffee addict: mug warmer","https://images.pexels.com/photos/13523793/pexels-photo-13523793.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Coffee mug on a heated mug warmer","For the guy who always forgets his coffee on the desk. Keeps it hot for hours, so every sip tastes like the first.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CC8DS2S5?tag=relations0237-20","For the whiskey lover: chilling stones gift set","https://images.pexels.com/photos/36322544/pexels-photo-36322544.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Whiskey stones in a gift box with glasses","Keeps his drink cold without watering it down. Comes ready to gift. Simple, classy, and over 13,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B014Q2R6GS?tag=relations0237-20","For the car guy: LEGO Technic Bugatti Bolide","https://images.pexels.com/photos/34200502/pexels-photo-34200502.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","LEGO Technic race car model set","A detailed race car he builds himself. Hours of focus and fun, and it looks amazing on the shelf after. 4.8 stars.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBWG5T23?tag=relations0237-20","For the grill master: TempPro wireless meat thermometer","https://images.pexels.com/photos/28292008/pexels-photo-28292008.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Wireless meat thermometer next to a grill","No more cutting the steak open to check. Two probes and a 500-foot range, so he can watch the game while the brisket cooks. Over 30,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GE77QT0?tag=relations0237-20","Grooming gifts that upgrade his look","Smelling good and looking sharp is a gift for both of you. These are easy wins, especially if he still uses the same body spray from college.",[156,157,158,159],{"_114":175,"_19":176,"_117":177,"_119":178,"_121":179},{"_114":170,"_19":171,"_117":172,"_119":173,"_121":174},{"_114":165,"_19":166,"_117":167,"_119":168,"_121":169},{"_114":160,"_19":161,"_117":162,"_119":163,"_121":164},"Best for a clean shave: Philips Norelco OneBlade 360","https://images.pexels.com/photos/7320120/pexels-photo-7320120.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Close-up of a man shaving his face","Trims, edges and shaves with one tool, without razor burn. Perfect for the stubble look. Over 14,000 reviews, and he can use it wet in the shower.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZQTSBWZ?tag=relations0237-20","Best for beards: Viking Revolution beard kit","https://images.pexels.com/photos/3998402/pexels-photo-3998402.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Beard grooming kit with oil, balm and comb","Oil, balm, brush, comb and scissors in one box. Almost 20,000 reviews. His beard gets softer, and so do your kisses.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B53Q3BX?tag=relations0237-20","Best luxury cologne: Gucci Guilty pour Homme","https://images.pexels.com/photos/32645070/pexels-photo-32645070.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Luxury men's fragrance bottle","Warm, a little spicy and seriously attractive. The grown-up fragrance upgrade that makes you lean in for a hug.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004O24Q8W?tag=relations0237-20","Best value cologne: Nautica Voyage","https://images.pexels.com/photos/34051691/pexels-photo-34051691.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Bottle of men's cologne","Fresh, clean and loved by over 150,000 buyers. The safe bet if you do not know his taste yet.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000P22TIY?tag=relations0237-20","Cozy gifts for winter","It is cold, he is tired, and his hoodie has holes in it. These gifts make his winter a lot more comfortable, and yes, you will probably steal the hoodie.",[183,184,185,186],{"_114":202,"_19":203,"_117":204,"_119":205,"_121":206},{"_114":197,"_19":198,"_117":199,"_119":200,"_121":201},{"_114":192,"_19":193,"_117":194,"_119":195,"_121":196},{"_114":187,"_19":188,"_117":189,"_119":190,"_121":191},"Coziest gift ever: The Comfy original wearable blanket","https://images.pexels.com/photos/10761593/pexels-photo-10761593.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Person wrapped in a soft brown blanket","A giant sherpa hoodie that is basically a blanket with sleeves. The Shark Tank hit with over 95,000 reviews. One size fits all, so you can borrow it (and you will).","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DKTDBWC?tag=relations0237-20","Best for stress: shiatsu neck and back massager","https://images.pexels.com/photos/7298867/pexels-photo-7298867.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Shiatsu neck massager with heat","Desk job? Gym sore? He will use this every evening. Deep-kneading nodes plus heat, with more than 50,000 reviews. Basically a massage that never gets tired.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DBY2X24?tag=relations0237-20","Best slippers: VeraCosy memory foam slippers","https://images.pexels.com/photos/12969102/pexels-photo-12969102.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Men's memory foam house slippers","Over 40,000 reviews. Like walking on a pillow, with a sole thick enough to step outside to get the mail.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CLXD2V4?tag=relations0237-20","Most loved: Carhartt loose-fit hoodie","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6667662/pexels-photo-6667662.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Man wearing a classic heavy hoodie in winter","The hoodie every guy wants, with over 50,000 reviews. Heavy, warm, and built to last for years. Pick a size up for that relaxed fit.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002G9UD8W?tag=relations0237-20","Everyday upgrades (he will use these every single day)","The best gifts for guys are things they need but would never buy for themselves. These replace something old and worn out, and he will think of you every time he uses them.",[210,211,212,213,214,215,216],{"_114":247,"_19":248,"_117":249,"_119":250,"_121":251},{"_114":242,"_19":243,"_117":244,"_119":245,"_121":246},{"_114":237,"_19":238,"_117":239,"_119":240,"_121":241},{"_114":232,"_19":233,"_117":234,"_119":235,"_121":236},{"_114":227,"_19":228,"_117":229,"_119":230,"_121":231},{"_114":222,"_19":223,"_117":224,"_119":225,"_121":226},{"_114":217,"_19":218,"_117":219,"_119":220,"_121":221},"Best for travel: Elviros toiletry bag","https://images.pexels.com/photos/9185864/pexels-photo-9185864.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Black toiletry bag for travel","Is he still packing his toothbrush in a plastic bag? This roomy dopp kit holds everything and looks sharp in any suitcase. Over 16,000 reviews.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z4Q5YPN?tag=relations0237-20","Best for his nightstand: TESLYAR wood docking station","https://images.pexels.com/photos/5827831/pexels-photo-5827831.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Wallet, watch and keys on a wooden table","One spot for his phone, wallet, keys and watch, so he stops asking \"have you seen my keys?\" Real wood, over 11,000 reviews, and it looks great on a dresser.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PNKKS78?tag=relations0237-20","Best for the guy who loses everything: Apple AirTag 4-pack","https://images.pexels.com/photos/20693249/pexels-photo-20693249.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Close-up of a set of keys","Keys, wallet, backpack, gym bag: put an AirTag on each and he finds them from his iPhone in seconds. Over 48,000 reviews. Good to know: it works with iPhone only.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0D54JZTHY?tag=relations0237-20","Best for his commute: YETI Rambler 20 oz tumbler","https://images.pexels.com/photos/9245381/pexels-photo-9245381.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Hand holding a matte black insulated tumbler","Hot coffee at 8am, still hot at noon. Ice water that stays cold in a hot car. Over 155,000 reviews, and it is tough enough to survive being dropped (a lot).","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073WJMKHN?tag=relations0237-20","Best speaker: Anker Soundcore 2","https://images.pexels.com/photos/374110/pexels-photo-374110.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Small portable bluetooth speaker","Over 150,000 reviews. Waterproof, 24-hour battery, and big sound for its size. For the shower, the car, the gym and the beach.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MTB55WH?tag=relations0237-20","Best for tech guys: 3-in-1 wireless charging stand","https://images.pexels.com/photos/17800265/pexels-photo-17800265.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Wireless charging stand for phone, watch and earbuds","Charges his phone, watch and earbuds at the same time, with no cable mess on the nightstand. Practical, clean and very easy to love.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0CNTH3F7P?tag=relations0237-20","Best wallet: HIMI genuine leather bifold","https://images.pexels.com/photos/7952556/pexels-photo-7952556.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Brown leather bifold wallet for men","Is his current wallet falling apart? Thought so. Over 31,000 reviews for this soft leather wallet with RFID protection. Pair it with the engraved card above for the perfect combo.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074W2VP89?tag=relations0237-20","Sentimental gifts (the ones that make him quiet for a second)","Guys pretend they are not sentimental. Then they keep your note in their wallet for 6 years. These gifts carry your words or your moments, and that is what makes them hit.",[255,256,257],{"_114":268,"_19":269,"_117":270,"_119":271,"_121":272},{"_114":263,"_19":264,"_117":265,"_119":266,"_121":267},{"_114":258,"_19":259,"_117":260,"_119":261,"_121":262},"Best for date nights: We're Not Really Strangers card game","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6803652/pexels-photo-6803652.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Card game for couples on a coffee table","The viral question game, with over 6,000 reviews. It turns a normal night in into the deepest conversation you have had in months. Fair warning: you will both learn something new.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092GM9NWH?tag=relations0237-20","Best for the guy who never says it: What I Love About You fill-in book","https://images.pexels.com/photos/3847713/pexels-photo-3847713.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Open book with a love note tucked inside","A little book of prompts like \"I love the way you...\" that you fill in with your own words. It takes one evening to write, and he will keep it forever. Over 22,000 reviews, and a lot of them say he read it twice.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/1601064934?tag=relations0237-20","Top pick: engraved wallet love note card","https://images.pexels.com/photos/6519139/pexels-photo-6519139.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=600&h=600&fit=crop","Engraved metal wallet card with a love message","A thin metal card with your message engraved on it, made to sit in his wallet forever. Every time he pays for coffee, he sees it. 4.8 stars from hundreds of girlfriends and wives who say he teared up.","https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YD2HWYK?tag=relations0237-20",{"_274":275},"origin","https://relationshipgoals.store"]
